{"title": "The Wail", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">The Wail</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-image\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game\">In-Game</div></div><a href=\"/wiki/File:The_Wail.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"The Wail.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/The_Wail.jpg/250px-The_Wail.jpg?cf7759\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/The_Wail.jpg/375px-The_Wail.jpg?cf7759 1.5x, /images/thumb/The_Wail.jpg/500px-The_Wail.jpg?cf7759 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Information\">Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-VariantOf\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-VariantOf\">Variant Of</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-VariantOf druid-data-nonempty\">\nBracken</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InternalID\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InternalID\">Internal ID</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InternalID druid-data-nonempty\">\nFloatingGirlHead</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaxCount\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaxCount\">Max Count</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaxCount druid-data-nonempty\">\n1</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-PowerLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-PowerLevel\">Power Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-PowerLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\n3</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-CauseofDeath\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-CauseofDeath\">Cause of Death</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-CauseofDeath druid-data-nonempty\">\nStrangulation</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-IsBodyRecoverable\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-IsBodyRecoverable\">Is Body Recoverable?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-IsBodyRecoverable druid-data-nonempty\">\nYes</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Stats\">Stats</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Health\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Health\">Health</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Health druid-data-nonempty\">\n10</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Damage\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Damage\">Damage</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Damage druid-data-nonempty\">\nInstant Kill</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DoorSpeedMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DoorSpeedMultiplier\">Door Speed Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DoorSpeedMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n1.25</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-StunTimeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-StunTimeMultiplier\">Stun Time Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-StunTimeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n0.25</div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>The Wail</b> is a hostile entity and variant of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Bracken\">Bracken</a> added by <b>Wesley's Ememy Variants</b>. It is a pale floating head with hollowed out eyes, long black hair, and a fleshy appendage where its neck should be.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Mechanics\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Mechanics\">&gt; Mechanics</span></h2>\n<p>Similar to the Bracken, <b>The Wail</b> will silently stalk players and attempt to sneak up behind them to snap their neck with its long hair. If a player spots <b>The Wail</b> within the middle of their screen, it will be startled, begin to move towards its chosen room, wait, and repeat the whole process. Staring at <b>The Wail</b> increases the likelihood of it attempting to chase and attack the closest employee, and directly attacking <b>The Wail</b> instantly triggers this.\n</p><p>Any player that comes into contact with <b>The Wail</b> will be killed and it will attempt to drag their corpse to its chosen room. There currently is a bug where <b>The Wail</b> can take double damage, making it possible to instantly kill it with any form of double-barrel shotgun and do upwards of 8 damage per shot with a <b>Single-barrel shotgun</b>.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Spawn_Conditions\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Spawn_Conditions\">&gt; Spawn Conditions</span></h2>\n<p><b>The Wail</b> immediately spawns in the interior upon landing on a moon during <a href=\"/wiki/Weathers#&gt;_Forsaken\" title=\"Weathers\"><b>Forsaken</b></a> weather. This spawn does not contribute to the <b>Interior Power Level</b> of a moon.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Bestiary_Entry\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Bestiary_Entry\">&gt; Bestiary Entry</span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>The wail <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">I hear her in the dark<br />There\u2019s a sadness in her voice<br />Something is wrong with her<br /><br />She fears being seen<br />She\u2019s scared<br />Something happened to her<br /><br />There is a darkness in her eyes<br />It\u2019s not her<br />Something is within<br /><br />Watch your back<br />She might ask for help<br />But it won\u2019t let you\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Audio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Audio\">&gt; Audio</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Audio\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Action</th>\n<th>Sound\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Being Spotted</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"9\" data-mwtitle=\"HeadScare1.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/HeadScare1.mp3?9dd397\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/HeadScare1.mp3/HeadScare1.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Attacking</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"23\" data-mwtitle=\"HeadAngry.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/HeadAngry.mp3?5bbe44\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/HeadAngry.mp3/HeadAngry.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Neck Snap</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"3\" data-mwtitle=\"HeadNeckCrack.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/HeadNeckCrack.mp3?6e2426\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/HeadNeckCrack.mp3/HeadNeckCrack.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dying</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"7\" data-mwtitle=\"HeadDeath.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/HeadDeath.mp3?e578bc\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/HeadDeath.mp3/HeadDeath.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Trivia\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Trivia\">&gt; Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Prior to the <b>Obscurity</b> update, <b>The Wail</b> was called <b>Floating Head</b>, being more similar to its Internal ID.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:TheWailCorpse.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Wail holding a player&#39;s corpse.\"><img alt=\"The Wail holding a player&#39;s corpse.\" src=\"/images/thumb/TheWailCorpse.jpg/120px-TheWailCorpse.jpg?8808f0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/TheWailCorpse.jpg/180px-TheWailCorpse.jpg?8808f0 1.5x, /images/thumb/TheWailCorpse.jpg/240px-TheWailCorpse.jpg?8808f0 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Wail holding a player's corpse.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:TheWailDeath.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Wail disintegrating after being killed.\"><img alt=\"The Wail disintegrating after being killed.\" src=\"/images/thumb/TheWailDeath.jpg/120px-TheWailDeath.jpg?c6a9e3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/TheWailDeath.jpg/180px-TheWailDeath.jpg?c6a9e3 1.5x, /images/thumb/TheWailDeath.jpg/240px-TheWailDeath.jpg?c6a9e3 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Wail disintegrating after being killed.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n</ul></div>", "images": ["The_Wail.jpg", "TheWailCorpse.jpg", "TheWailDeath.jpg", "HeadScare1.mp3", "HeadAngry.mp3", "HeadNeckCrack.mp3", "HeadDeath.mp3"], "cats": ["Pages_with_DRUID_infoboxes"]}